WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:01.500
Show me the girl

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.040
What is if she is the one who will break this spell?

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:04.980
You must charm her

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.840
Be gentle

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:06.540
Kind

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:07.140
Sweet

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.520
Come, come, show me the smile

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:10.760
Oh dear...

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.260
Woah

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.980
The master's not as terrible as he appears

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.780
I never thanked you for saving my life

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.980
I never thanked you for not leaving me to be eaten by wolves

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.060
Papa?

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:06.280
Belle you must leave here. This castle... is... alive.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.300
Who's there?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.220
Do you wish to take your fathers place?

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:11.960
Come into the light.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.760
Show me the girl

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:24.500
Look at her, what if she is the one?

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.460
The one who will break this spell

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:29.760
'Allo!

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:30.780
You can talk?

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.660
Well of course he can talk!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:35.280
Hello! Pleased to meet you!

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.640
The master's not as terrible as he appears.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:51.380
I SAY WE KILL THE BEAST!

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:55.860
Think of the one thing you've always wanted.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.800
Now find it in your mind's eye.

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.940
And feel it in your heart.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:05.740
No!

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.160
Don't be afraid.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:10.840
I'm not afraid.

